# Salted SHA-256 of names that must not appear in this public repository.
# The roster holds hashes so that guarding against personal data does not
# itself commit personal data. The salt is not a secret: it only stops a
# plain rainbow-table lookup, and the names it covers are public anyway.
#
# Add a name:  .githooks/pii-roster-add 'Eesnimi Perekonnanimi'
salt=tuleva-pii-roster-v1
